    "Built-in presets and manual controls share the same validated conversion plans. Video resolution and an optional per-file size limit are chosen for each job in the Island." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"内置预设与手动设置共用同一套经过验证的转换方案。每次任务的视频分辨率和可选单文件大小限制都在刘海窗口中选择。"}}}},
