    "File Island's original code is proprietary and source-available. File Island includes FFmpeg 8.1.2 under the GNU LGPL v2.1 or later. The corresponding source archive, verified release signature, build recipe, license, and notices are included with the project and every binary Release. No GPL or nonfree components are enabled." : {"localizations":{"zh-Hans":{"stringUnit":{"state":"translated","value":"File Island 的原创代码保留所有权利并开放源码查看。File Island 包含依据 GNU LGPL v2.1 或更高版本授权的 FFmpeg 8.1.2。对应源码归档、经验证的发布签名、构建方法、许可证和声明均随项目及每个二进制 Release 提供。当前未启用 GPL 或 nonfree 组件。"}}}},
